Z||000000||hugh||04-04-2001||08:45 PM||||I just put Ryane's tubular front end on my 88GT.Has anyone else used them?I can't get the correct camber because the upper control arms won't move towards the chassis enough.The arms have to be unbolted from the chassis and the holes elongated.Has anyone had this problem,and if so ,how did you correct it?||||reg||5
